PLAN 2.2 — C-PARITY SHIMS RUN AGAINST ALL THREE REGISTERED ORACLES.
Measured after the ZEN_ORACLE_* bridging landed; every shim compiles and
links under hybrid-3115, mainline-4.2.0 and ghost-robot.

date:   2026-09-25
host:   i265 (x86_64 Linux 7.0.0-34-generic), gcc, lld
cmd:    SVT_ORACLE=<oracle> CARGO_TARGET_DIR=$HOME/tmp/target-<o> \
        cargo nextest run --no-fail-fast -p zenav1-svt-encoder \
        -p zenav1-svt-dsp -E 'binary(/c_parity/) | test(/c_parity/)'
        (under run-heavy --mem 8G --jobs 6; 875 tests selected per oracle)

